Third-party code in autocalibration/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the MAD-SAGE model code. Files in autocalibration/
that were adapted from other projects keep their original licences, as stated
in each file's header:

- main.py, analysis.py, common.py, constraints.py, diagnostics.py:
  adapted from the Shark PSO code, (c) The University of Western Australia
  (ICRAR), GNU General Public License v3 or later.
- execution.py: adapted from the Shark PSO code, (c) The University of Western
  Australia (ICRAR), GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later.
- pso.py: adapted from pyswarm v0.7 (https://github.com/tisimst/pyswarm).
